        <part>
03 D7 FC 28 91 28 45 41 41 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 01 01 01 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
02 01 00 03 00 00 00 20 00 00 00 02 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 28 03 02 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
